  "keyFeatures": [
    "Private AI inference inside Trusted Execution Environments (TEEs) — no data visible to cloud or model providers",
    "OpenAI-compatible API — drop-in replacement with `base_url` override",
    "Cryptographic attestation and chat signing for end-to-end verifiability",
    "Direct completions endpoints per model (`{slug}.completions.near.ai`) for lower latency and simpler trust model",
    "Reasoning models (GLM, Qwen, GPT-OSS, Kimi) with configurable thinking",
    "Fusion: server-side multi-model deliberation in a single API call",
    "Built-in web search tools (`web_context_search`, `web_search`) with no client-side tool handling",
    "End-to-end encrypted (E2EE) chat completions using Ed25519 / XChaCha20-Poly1305",
    "Multimodal support: text, image input/generation, audio transcription, embeddings, reranking",
    "PII detection and redaction via privacy-filter model",
    "Prompt caching (automatic, TEE-isolated KV cache) for cost and latency savings",
    "Organization, workspace, and API key management with per-key spend limits",
    "Usage reporting API with cursor-paginated export and filtering by model, workspace, and date range"
  ],
